#: classes/Services/Notifications/FeatureAnnouncements.php:388
msgid "Your CTAs already track clicks. <strong>Vanity URLs in Popup Maker Pro</strong> replace long tracking links with branded paths such as <code>/go/summer-sale</code> that are easier to share and recognize."
